flowchart TB
    Sources[CRM / Imports / Webhooks / Fixtures] --> Events[Durable Domain Events]
    Events --> Store[(Operational Store<br/>SQLite / PostgreSQL target)]
    Store --> Orchestrator[Orchestrator<br/>State + Transitions]
    Orchestrator --> Agents[Agents<br/>Research · Outreach · Triage · Calls · Deal Desk]
    Orchestrator --> Skills[Deterministic Skills<br/>Scoring · Validation · Templates · Lessons]
    Agents --> Typed[Typed Proposal]
    Skills --> Typed
    Typed --> Policy[Policy Engine<br/>AUTO · REQUIRE_APPROVAL · DENY]
    Policy --> Outbox[Outbox]
    Policy --> Approvals[Human Approval Queue]
    Approvals --> Outbox
    Policy --> Audit[Audit Log]
    Outbox --> Adapters[Provider Adapters]
    Adapters --> CRM[HubSpot]
    Adapters --> Mail[Resend]
    Adapters --> Transcript[Fireflies]
    Adapters --> ESign[Dropbox Sign]
    Adapters --> Audit
